          <span class="quote-attrib">&ndash;Laura Fischer</span>
        </blockquote>
      </section>

      <hr class="redline">

      <section class="container-narrow">
        <p class="muted">Duke Aeroplane (Galen Cassidy Peria) was born at a very young age, somewhere not too far from here. Ever since then he has been having one heck of a time.</p>
        <p class="muted">He has toured extensively in the United States and Europe alongside &ldquo;Vermont Joy Parade,&rdquo; releasing two critically acclaimed studio albums and one feature-length tour-documentary film. He was a founding member of United Bakery Records, a New Orleans, Louisiana based independent record label and event company, under the auspices of which he released &ldquo;Duke Aeroplane &amp; The Wrong Numbers: Higher Ground&rdquo;. His feature-film writing/directorial debut, <a href="theheartbeatthehammer.html">&ldquo;The Heartbeat, The Hammer&rdquo;</a>, was also born from his association with the label and is set for release in November 2026. His latest recording endeavor, &ldquo;Duke Aeroplane &amp; The Rum Birds: New Orleans Night &ndash; Live in New Orleans&rdquo;, was recorded live in Marigny Studios with an all-star cast and released to acclaim in 2026.</p>
        <p class="muted">Both Peria and Aeroplane are available for various engagements and difficult situations, either in solo performance or with full band support.</p>
      </section>

